        "Title": "About summary",
        "paragraphs": [
          "I'm Youssef Amr a 21 years old Game Developer, Front-end  dev  and Data scientist who loves turning wild ideas into things you can actually Play, See, and learn from.",
          "I'm currently a data science student at Alexandria University, but my journey started long before that - tinkering with code, physics and the inner workings of machines. I even built a computer in a  simulator, coded in assembly, and climbed my way up to full-scale projects in Unity, Angular, Firebase, and AWS."
        ]
